findings.suggestion:
把来源/环境纳入键，并避免共享可变对象：

def cache_key(filename, source=None, env=None):
    return (source, env, filename)

def get_cached(name, loader, source=None, env=None):
    key = cache_key(name, source, env)
    with _LOCK:
        if key not in _CACHE:
            _CACHE[key] = copy.deepcopy(loader(name))
        return _CACHE[key]

