findings.suggestion:
按 EXPECTED_TYPES 做校验与转换，并在失败时立即报错定位：

for key, expected in EXPECTED_TYPES.items():
    if key not in config:
        continue
    value = config[key]
    if not isinstance(value, expected):
        raise TypeError("配置 %s 期望 %s，实际 %s" % (key, expected.__name__, type(value).__name__))
    result[key] = value

如需兼容字符串，明确做显式转换（如 int(str)）并在失败时抛出带 key 的异常。

